<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">CONTACT</p><h1>Start with the right channel.</h1><p>We won't pretend a form was sent when no contact service is configured. Choose a public or private channel based on what you need to share.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container contact-grid">
    <article><span class="status status-implemented">Public discussion</span><h2>Questions and proposals</h2><p>Use the official Nora GitHub issue tracker for non-sensitive bug reports and feature requests. Do not include passwords, personal data, or vulnerability details.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="https://github.com/Yasser-devb/nora/issues" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit GitHub issues ↗</a></article>
    <article><span class="status status-experimental">Security</span><h2>Potential vulnerability?</h2><p>Use GitHub's private vulnerability reporting only if it is enabled for the official repository. Repository settings have not been independently verified by this website. Avoid public disclosure until the maintainer has had a reasonable opportunity to respond.</p><a class="button button-outline" href="https://github.com/Yasser-devb/nora/security/advisories/new" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check private reporting ↗</a></article>
</div><div class="container governance-note"><strong>Maintainer authority</strong><p>The authorized maintainer controls official repository merges, releases, and announcements. No personal email address or service-level response guarantee is currently configured here.</p></div></section>
